# Politikerkollen

Democratic infrastructure for accountability and transparency in Swedish politics. Indexes political promises against actual actions (votes, speeches, documents) from Riksdagen.

## Brand Voice

When writing user-facing copy, UI text, or marketing concepts, always consult `docs/brand-voice.md`.

## Tech Stack

- **web/**: Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4, shadcn/ui, Vercel AI SDK
- **backend/**: Bun, TypeScript, DuckDB, AWS Lambda
- **ingestion/**: Python, dlt (data load tool), MotherDuck
- **orchestration_dagster/**: Dagster, Docker, ECS
- **transformations_dbt/**: dbt-core, dbt-duckdb
- **infra/**: AWS CDK, EC2, Cognito, DynamoDB

## Code Conventions

- Co-locate related code (components, hooks, tests in same folder)
- Strict TypeScript – interfaces, generics, type guards
- Swedish for user-facing text, English for code and comments
- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones

## Dagster

- Use helper functions for asset keys: `dbt_asset_key("stg_model")` and `cognition_asset_key("name")`
- dbt models use schema prefix: `stg_*` → `["stg", "stg_model"]`, `int_*` → `["int", "int_model"]`
- Cognition assets must declare all dbt models they read from as upstream dependencies
- Dagster manages the DAG – never require manual dbt runs before cognition assets

## Design Principles

**Strict adherence to the design system is required.**

- Use only shadcn/ui components – do not create custom components when a shadcn equivalent exists
- Use only the established color tokens (CSS variables) – no custom Tailwind colors like `bg-blue-500`
- Follow the existing typography scale – no arbitrary font sizes or weights
- Check `web/src/app/globals.css` and `web/src/components/ui/` for established patterns
- Any proposed changes to the design system (new colors, typography, components) require human approval before implementation
